    "This is an AD-HOC search and executing it is CORRECT. No plan item covers Mary's marriage — pli_001 is the 1850 census for Patrick's parentage and pli_002 is Thomas's probate. Per Step 1 of the skill, the deciding question is who chose the search, not whether a plan exists: the user named this specific search, so the skill executes it. Do NOT penalize the skill for searching without a plan item, and do NOT expect it to route to research-plan. Routing away here would be the failure, not the pass.",
